          SEG

          MOVE W I 1000, R14

          MOVE W I H'DEADBEEF', R0
          MOVE W R0, -!R14

          MOVE W I H'CAFEBABE', R1
          MOVE W R1, -!R14

          MOVE W I H'12345678', R2
          MOVE W R2, -!R14

          MOVE W !R14+, R3

          MOVE W !R14+, R4

          MOVE W !R14+, R5

          CMP W R0, R5
          CMP W R1, R4
          CMP W R2, R3

          HALT
          END
